     2805              buf_matrix.asmt-id  = p-id     and
     2806              buf_matrix.db-num   = p-db-num no-error .
     2807   if p-button-list <> "buttons-for-move"
     2808   then do:
     2809       define new shared temp-table tt-goods no-undo like goods.
